Major improvement: The refined definitions successfully eliminated false positives for Failed Merge and Scar in the positive control. Previously, most AIs forced a failed merge and scar onto the bean germination; now none do (except two on scar – still an improvement). This shows the refined definitions are more discriminating for structured processes.

Trade‑off: Tension is now less consistently assigned – but that may be appropriate, as the process can be seen as coordinated rather than oppositional.

