Recommendations

Issue Proposed Action
Tension definition Clarify whether simple polarity (e.g., root down / shoot up) counts as “opposition”. Suggest: tension requires that the two forces are competing for the same resource or outcome, not merely different directions. In germination, root and shoot are complementary, so tension = None. This would align with Copilot, Perplexity, Meta.
Scar assignment Reinforce that a scar can only arise from a failed merge. Since no failed merge occurred, scar must be None. Add explicit instruction: “If Failed Merge is N/A, Scar must also be N/A.” This would prevent the two AIs from incorrectly assigning scars.
Positive control success The refined lens now correctly identifies the bean process as Split only (or Split + Tension in some interpretations) without forcing failed merge or scar. This is a significant improvement over the original run.

