Final Verdict

The refined Prime Move lens passes the positive control with much better discrimination than the original. Unanimous Split, no false failed merges, and only minor scar false positives. The remaining ambiguity on Tension can be resolved with a tighter definition.

Next step: Proceed to edge cases with the same refined definitions, but consider adjusting the Tension definition before running them. The negative control (random sequence) already showed over‑detection of tension – this confirms that the definition needs to be stricter. We should update the Tension definition to require regular, structured opposition (e.g., periodic alternation, competing attractors with memory) rather than any high‑low variability.

